  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In the second white bone hall on Bai Gu mountain, Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing find Ribcage Shield Gu held in one of three white bone pillar hands beside Flying bone shield Gu and Arm bone wings Gu. Pillar text limits the inheritor to one choice among the three. Fang Yuan leaves it and takes Flying bone shield Gu instead.",
        "chapters": [
          222
